      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1904-04-09_WidnesExaminer_art0079" n="art0079">
        <head>DIED AT 101.</head>
        <p>DIED AT 101.</p>
        <p>A verdict of accidental death was returned At Boston Lincolnshire,on Wednesday,at an inquest upon Nathaniel Wright, thc oldest man in Lincolnshire. The deceased was 101 years of age. A few weeks ago he fell and fractured his thigh, which accelerated death. Until recently Wright used to walk eight miles daily. He was a non-smoker, but not a teetotaler. He spent the whole of his life in Lincolnshire.</p>
