        <head>SEAWEED AS A MEDICINE.</head>
        <p>SEAWEED AS A MEDICINE.</p>
        <p>ITS MARVELLOUS EFFECT UPON THE STOMACH, LIVER, KIDNEYS AND BLOOD.</p>
        <p>SEA.-WEED possesses a natural strengthening, healing, and purifying power, infinitely greater than ordinary medicines. This is now regarded as conclusive by eminent authorities, who recommend it daily since Veno's Sea-weed Tonic was first introduced.</p>
        <p>A pare palatable extract of Sea-weed is one of the Principle ingredients of Veno's Sea-weed Tonic, This remedy excels in the cure of INDIGESTION, WIND, HEADACHE, NERVOUS COMPLAINTS, KIDNEY TROUBLES, WEAK AND PAINFUL BACK, TORPID LIVER, FEMALE TROUBLES, POORNESS OF BLOOD AND "HABITUAL CON" STIPATION." its Most brilliant effect is produced 111 Stomach, Liver and Kidney Complaints. The remark- able cures Veno's Seaweed Tonic effect even in the worst cases is positive proof of its therapeutic value. Ask for VENO'S SEA-WEED ToNrc,.ls. 11d. and 2s. 9d. per bottle,. at Chemists and Drug Stores.</p>
